      "name": "Billing Function Maintenance - February 26, 2026",
      "status": "scheduled",
      "created_at": "2026-02-25T18:07:11.062Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-02-25T18:07:11.117Z",
      "monitoring_at": null,
      "resolved_at": null,
      "impact": "maintenance",
      "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/fdhr9lmnpq4f",
      "started_at": "2026-02-25T18:07:11.057Z",
      "page_id": "q7pxfmcf2sbx",
      "incident_updates": [
        {
          "id": "tzg8t1k1gjl8",
          "status": "scheduled",
          "body": "Our upstream billing provider is doing some <a href=\"https://status.withorb.com/incidents/71lzjrg9j87k\">important maintenance</a> on February 26, 2026. Their maintenance window is, very conservatively, from 0100-0500 UTC. They estimate that services will be impacted for approximately the first 5 minutes of this window. We have set this maintenance window for 1 hour from our side, but do not expect the impact to be longer than 5 minutes.\n\nProject availability, compute add-on changes, disk scaling, and other project configuration changes ARE NOT IMPACTED. All Postgres and Data API access WILL REMAIN FUNCTIONAL. Additionally Auth, Realtime, Storage, Edge Functions, and all other features will remain functional.\n\nThe impact for Supabase will be that the following activities will be restricted during this ~5 minute period:\n\nOrganization creation\nSubscription plan changes (e.g. upgrades/downgrades)\nCredit top-ups and redemptions\nBilling-related API requests (e.g. the billing dashboard pages for your organization)\n\nWe will be disabling these features starting at 01:00 UTC, and plan to re-enable them at 01:05 UTC, pending positive healthchecks from the upstream billing APIs.",
          "incident_id": "w1gz5ql9lrtb",
          "created_at": "2026-02-25T18:07:11.111Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-02-25T18:07:11.111Z",
